With FinamTrade keep up with the stock price of Russian and foreign issuers, bonds, currencies, ETF, as well as futures and options.

Check out real-time quotes and charts of financial instruments, trade, watch the course of trading, keep abreast of current exchange news and macroeconomic events — all in one application!

Key features:

• quotes and charts in real-time or with minimal delay;
• displaying the state of the trading account and open positions;
• in-app push notifications for trade orders status changes;
• customizable alerts to notify you about the market situation;
• buy and sell various assets: stocks, bonds, currencies, futures and options;
• ability to place all major types of trade orders;
• calendar of market statistics and macroeconomic events;
• viewing current financial news;
• technical analysis using charting tools and a wide range of indicators.

Updating of market data, execution of trading operations are possible in the operating hours of trading floors. During weekends and holidays, the quotes is displayed as of the end of the previous trading day. Data for some instruments may have a delay if you are not signed in.
